<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
    <meta name="description" content="Sudoers Security Audit Report. Identifies security misconfigurations, dangerous defaults, and GTFObins bypass vulnerabilities.">
    <title>Sudoers Audit Report - test-host</title>
    <script>
        (function() {
            try {
                var saved = localStorage.getItem('sudo-check-theme');
                if (saved === 'light' || saved === 'dark') {
                    document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', saved);
                }
            } catch (e) {}
        })();
    </script>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark;
            --bg-gradient-start: #0b0f19;
            --bg-gradient-end: #020617;
            --panel-bg: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.78);
            --panel-bg-elevated: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92);
            --panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --panel-border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            --surface-subtle: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
            --surface-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --pre-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
            --text-main: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --font-primary: 'Outfit', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            --font-code: 'Space Mono', 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', Consolas, monospace;
            --accent-primary: #4f46e5;
            --accent-primary-bg: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.16);
            --accent-crit: #ff6961;
            --accent-high: #d8b4fe;
            --accent-med: #ff9f0a;
            --accent-low: #64d2ff;
            --accent-info: #60a5fa;
            --accent-crit-bg: rgba(255, 69, 58, 0.15);
            --accent-high-bg: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.15);
            --accent-med-bg: rgba(255, 159, 10, 0.15);
            --accent-low-bg: rgba(100, 210, 255, 0.15);
            --accent-info-bg: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.15);
            --remediation-accent: #34d399;
            --remediation-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.07);
            --exploit-accent: #fbbf24;
            --exploit-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
            --code-text: #34d399;
            --exploit-code-text: #fbbf24;
            --domain-badge-bg: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
            --domain-badge-text: #38bdf8;
            --domain-badge-border: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
            --indigo-badge-bg: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14);
            --indigo-badge-bg-hover: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
            --indigo-badge-text: #a5b4fc;
            --indigo-badge-border: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            --link-color: #38bdf8;
            --shadow-glow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
        }

        [data-theme="light"] {
            color-scheme: light;
            --bg-gradient-start: #f8fafc;
            --bg-gradient-end: #e2e8f0;
            --panel-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            --panel-bg-elevated: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
            --panel-border: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
            --panel-border-strong: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
            --surface-subtle: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
            --surface-hover: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
            --pre-bg: #f1f5f9;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #475569;
            --accent-crit: #b91c1c;
            --accent-high: #7e22ce;
            --accent-med: #92400e;
            --accent-low: #0369a1;
            --accent-info: #1d4ed8;
            --accent-crit-bg: rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.09);
            --accent-high-bg: rgba(126, 34, 206, 0.09);
            --accent-med-bg: rgba(146, 64, 14, 0.09);
            --accent-low-bg: rgba(3, 105, 161, 0.09);
            --accent-info-bg: rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.09);
            --remediation-accent: #047857;
            --remediation-bg: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.06);
            --exploit-accent: #92400e;
            --exploit-bg: rgba(146, 64, 14, 0.07);
            --code-text: #065f46;
            --exploit-code-text: #92400e;
            --domain-badge-bg: rgba(3, 105, 161, 0.09);
            --domain-badge-text: #0369a1;
            --domain-badge-border: rgba(3, 105, 161, 0.25);
            --indigo-badge-bg: rgba(67, 56, 202, 0.09);
            --indigo-badge-bg-hover: rgba(67, 56, 202, 0.18);
            --indigo-badge-text: #4338ca;
            --indigo-badge-border: rgba(67, 56, 202, 0.28);
            --link-color: #0369a1;
            --shadow-glow: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
        }

        .skip-link {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0.5rem;
            left: 0.5rem;
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .skip-link:not(:focus):not(:active) {
            position: absolute;
            width: 1px;
            height: 1px;
            padding: 0;
            margin: -1px;
            overflow: hidden;
            clip-path: inset(50%);
            white-space: nowrap;
            border: 0;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-gradient-start) 0%, var(--bg-gradient-end) 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1320px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .header-title h1 {
            font-size: 1.65rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #818cf8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .header-title p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 0.15rem;
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .action-btn,
        .theme-toggle-btn {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-main);
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .action-btn:hover,
        .theme-toggle-btn:hover {
            background: var(--surface-hover);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }
        .system-meta {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .meta-item {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
        }

        .meta-item strong {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .meta-pill {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }
        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(140px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            width: 100%;
            transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .metric-card.active-metric {
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-primary), 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .metric-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
        }

        .card-crit::before { background: var(--accent-crit); }
        .card-high::before { background: var(--accent-high); }
        .card-med::before { background: var(--accent-med); }
        .card-low::before { background: var(--accent-low); }
        .card-info::before { background: var(--accent-info); }

        .metric-num {
            display: block;
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0.25rem 0 0.1rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .metric-label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .metric-hint {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .severity-distribution {
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .sev-seg-crit { background: var(--accent-crit); width: 28.57%; }
        .sev-seg-high { background: var(--accent-high); width: 28.57%; }
        .sev-seg-med { background: var(--accent-med); width: 14.29%; }
        .sev-seg-low { background: var(--accent-low); width: 14.29%; }
        .sev-seg-info { background: var(--accent-info); width: 14.29%; }
        .triage-overview {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--shadow-glow);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .triage-overview > summary {
            list-style: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .triage-overview > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        .triage-overview[open] > summary {
            border-bottom-color: var(--panel-border);
        }

        .triage-summary-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
        }

        .triage-summary-hint {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .triage-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
        }

        .triage-panel {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.65rem;
        }

        .triage-panel-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .triage-panel-header-spaced {
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
        }

        .triage-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            max-height: 210px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding-right: 0.2rem;
        }

        .triage-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.42rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .triage-row:hover {
            background: var(--surface-hover);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .triage-row.active-facet {
            background: var(--accent-primary-bg);
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }

        .triage-row-name {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .triage-row-badges {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.25rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .mini-sev {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.1rem 0.38rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .mini-total {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-left: 0.2rem;
        }
        .controls-panel {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0.75rem;
            z-index: 40;
            background: var(--panel-bg-elevated);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--shadow-glow);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .toolbar-top-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .search-bar {
            position: relative;
            flex: 1 1 280px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .search-input {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.6rem 4.2rem 0.6rem 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .search-input:focus {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
            outline-offset: -1px;
        }

        .search-shortcut {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0.55rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.3rem;
        }

        .kbd-hint {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 0.08rem 0.38rem;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .clear-search-btn {
            display: none;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .clear-search-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: var(--surface-hover);
        }

        .facet-selects {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .toolbar-select-group {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .toolbar-select {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            max-width: 220px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .toolbar-select:focus {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
            outline-offset: -1px;
        }

        .toolbar-filters-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
        }

        .filter-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.38rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.38rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 7px;
            font-size: 0.79rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .filter-btn.active {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }

        .filter-btn:hover:not(.active) {
            background: var(--surface-hover);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .policy-filter-group {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.25rem;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.3rem;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 9px;
            transition: border-color 0.15s, background-color 0.15s;
        }

        .policy-filter-group.has-active-policy {
            border-color: var(--indigo-badge-border);
            background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.04);
        }

        .policy-filter-group .filter-btn-parent {
            border-color: transparent;
            background: transparent;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .policy-filter-group .filter-btn-parent.active {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .policy-filter-group .filter-btn-parent.parent-context:not(.active) {
            color: var(--indigo-badge-text);
            background: var(--indigo-badge-bg);
        }

        .policy-subfilters {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.22rem;
            padding-left: 0.35rem;
            border-left: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .policy-subfilters .filter-btn-sub {
            border-color: transparent;
            background: transparent;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.24rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .policy-subfilters .filter-btn-sub:hover:not(.active) {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: var(--surface-hover);
        }

        .policy-subfilters .filter-btn-sub.active {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .view-mode-group {
            display: inline-flex;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
        }

        .view-mode-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.38rem 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .view-mode-btn.active {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .toolbar-status-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding-top: 0.45rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .active-filters-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
        }

        .active-filter-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--accent-primary-bg);
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--indigo-badge-border);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .reset-filters-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: none;
        }

        .reset-filters-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }
        .findings-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .finding-group {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--shadow-glow);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .finding-card:nth-child(n+6),
        .finding-group:nth-child(n+4) {
            content-visibility: auto;
            contain-intrinsic-size: auto none auto 220px;
        }

        .finding-group-header {
            list-style: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            user-select: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .finding-group-header::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        .finding-group[open] > .finding-group-header {
            border-bottom-color: var(--panel-border);
        }

        .group-header-left {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            min-width: 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .group-chevron {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .finding-group[open] > .finding-group-header .group-chevron {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }

        .group-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .group-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
        }

        .group-shared-remediation {
            margin: 0.85rem 1rem 0;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--remediation-accent);
            background: var(--remediation-bg);
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
        }

        .group-shared-remediation strong {
            color: var(--remediation-accent);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .finding-group-body {
            padding: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.85rem;
        }
        .finding-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.9rem;
        }

        .finding-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .finding-title-sec {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.3rem;
            min-width: 0;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .finding-meta-top {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .finding-id {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            padding: 0.12rem 0.45rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        button.finding-id {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button.finding-id:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
            background: var(--accent-primary-bg);
        }

        .domain-badge {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.12rem 0.48rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--domain-badge-bg);
            color: var(--domain-badge-text);
            border: 1px solid var(--domain-badge-border);
        }

        .location-pill {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        button.location-pill {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button.location-pill:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .finding-title {
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .compact-summary-pills {
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.74rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .compact-pill {
            padding: 0.12rem 0.45rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            max-width: 240px;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .finding-header-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .sev-badge {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.28rem 0.72rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .badge-crit { background: var(--accent-crit-bg); color: var(--accent-crit); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 69, 58, 0.35); }
        .badge-high { background: var(--accent-high-bg); color: var(--accent-high); border: 1px solid rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.35); }
        .badge-med { background: var(--accent-med-bg); color: var(--accent-med); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 159, 10, 0.35); }
        .badge-low { background: var(--accent-low-bg); color: var(--accent-low); border: 1px solid rgba(100, 210, 255, 0.35); }
        .badge-info { background: var(--accent-info-bg); color: var(--accent-info); border: 1px solid rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.35); }

        .compact-toggle-btn {
            display: none;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .finding-expandable-body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.85rem;
        }
        .rule-preview-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
            padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .rule-preview-code {
            color: var(--text-main);
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .copy-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--panel-border-strong);
        }

        .finding-details-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: safe center;
            gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            padding: 0.65rem 0.95rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        .finding-detail-item {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            min-inline-size: 0;
            max-inline-size: 100%;
        }

        .finding-detail-item strong {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            white-space: nowrap;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .finding-detail-item span,
        .finding-detail-item code,
        .finding-detail-item button {
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .clickable-meta {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            padding: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font: inherit;
            text-align: left;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-decoration-style: dotted;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }

        .clickable-meta:hover {
            color: var(--indigo-badge-text);
        }

        .compliance-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.4rem;
        }

        .compliance-badge {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            padding: 0.18rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--indigo-badge-bg);
            color: var(--indigo-badge-text);
            border: 1px solid var(--indigo-badge-border);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .compliance-badge:hover,
        .compliance-badge.active-facet {
            background: var(--indigo-badge-bg-hover);
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }

        .finding-desc {
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .finding-remediation {
            border-left: 3px solid var(--remediation-accent);
            background: var(--remediation-bg);
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .remediation-title {
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--remediation-accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .remediation-content {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .remediation-code-block {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .remediation-code-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .remediation-code-label {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            color: var(--remediation-accent);
        }

        .remediation-code-block pre {
            margin-top: 0.15rem;
        }
        .finding-exploit {
            border-left: 3px solid var(--exploit-accent);
            background: var(--exploit-bg);
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .exploit-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .exploit-title {
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--exploit-accent);
        }

        pre {
            background: var(--pre-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 7px;
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
            color: var(--code-text);
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .finding-exploit pre {
            color: var(--exploit-code-text);
            margin-top: 0.15rem;
        }
        .findings-list.view-compact {
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-group-body {
            gap: 0.45rem;
            padding: 0.65rem;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-card {
            padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-header {
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-title-sec {
            flex-direction: row;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: nowrap;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-meta-top {
            flex-wrap: nowrap;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .location-pill {
            max-width: 220px;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-title {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-right: auto;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .compact-summary-pills {
            display: inline-flex;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            flex-wrap: nowrap;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .compact-toggle-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
        }

        .findings-list.view-compact .finding-expandable-body {
            padding-top: 0.65rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        .no-findings {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        :where(button, a, select, input, summary, pre):focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent-primary);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }
        .view-tabs {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.45rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .view-tab-btn {
            flex: 1 1 220px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.55rem;
            padding: 0.68rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.15s, color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .view-tab-btn:hover:not([aria-selected="true"]) {
            background: var(--surface-hover);
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .view-tab-btn[aria-selected="true"] {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
        }

        .tab-badge {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.12rem 0.48rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
            color: inherit;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        }

        .view-tab-btn:not([aria-selected="true"]) .tab-badge {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border-color: var(--panel-border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .tab-badge-ok {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14) !important;
            color: var(--remediation-accent) !important;
            border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35) !important;
        }

        .view-tab-btn[aria-selected="true"] .tab-badge-ok {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) !important;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) !important;
        }

        .view-tabpanel[hidden] {
            display: none !important;
        }
        .frameworks-intro-banner,
        .template-intro-banner {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow-glow);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .frameworks-intro-banner h2,
        .template-intro-banner h2 {
            font-size: 1.22rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .frameworks-intro-banner p,
        .template-intro-banner p {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .framework-group-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--shadow-glow);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .framework-group-header {
            list-style: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 1.05rem 1.35rem;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            user-select: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .framework-group-header::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        .framework-group-card[open] > .framework-group-header {
            border-bottom-color: var(--panel-border);
        }

        .framework-group-card[open] > .framework-group-header .group-chevron {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }

        .framework-group-meta {
            padding: 0.9rem 1.35rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .framework-meta-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .framework-meta-links a {
            color: var(--link-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .framework-meta-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .framework-reqs-body {
            padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .framework-req-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg-elevated);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.15rem 1.3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .framework-req-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .framework-req-title-wrap {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.28rem;
            min-width: 0;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .framework-req-code {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.14rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--indigo-badge-bg);
            color: var(--indigo-badge-text);
            border: 1px solid var(--indigo-badge-border);
        }

        .framework-level-pill {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.12rem 0.48rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        .badge-compliant {
            background: var(--remediation-bg);
            color: var(--remediation-accent);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
        }

        .verbatim-box {
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .verbatim-label {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--indigo-badge-text);
        }

        .verbatim-quote {
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--text-main);
            white-space: pre-line;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .verbatim-quote-fr {
            font-size: 0.83rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--panel-border);
            padding-top: 0.45rem;
            white-space: pre-line;
        }

        .req-cross-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            padding-top: 0.4rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
        }

        .req-rule-pills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
        }

        .req-pills-label {
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-right: 0.25rem;
        }

        .req-action-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.45rem;
        }

        .jump-btn {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.68rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
        }

        .jump-btn:hover {
            background: var(--accent-primary-bg);
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        .template-quick-nav {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .template-section-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.3rem 1.45rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--shadow-glow);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.85rem;
        }

        .template-section-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .template-highlights {
            list-style: disc;
            padding-left: 1.25rem;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }

        .traceability-card {
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-strong);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.3rem 1.45rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--shadow-glow);
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .traceability-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
        }

        .traceability-table caption {
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .traceability-table th,
        .traceability-table td {
            padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            text-align: left;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .traceability-table th {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
        }

        .traceability-table code {
            font-family: var(--font-code);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            color: var(--code-text);
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .metrics-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
            .controls-panel {
                position: static;
            }
        }

        @media print {
            :root,
            [data-theme="dark"],
            [data-theme="light"] {
                color-scheme: light !important;
                --panel-bg: #ffffff !important;
                --panel-bg-elevated: #ffffff !important;
                --panel-border: #cbd5e1 !important;
                --panel-border-strong: #94a3b8 !important;
                --surface-subtle: #f8fafc !important;
                --pre-bg: #f1f5f9 !important;
                --text-main: #0f172a !important;
                --text-muted: #475569 !important;
                --accent-crit: #b91c1c !important;
                --accent-high: #7e22ce !important;
                --accent-med: #92400e !important;
                --accent-low: #0369a1 !important;
                --accent-info: #1d4ed8 !important;
                --remediation-accent: #047857 !important;
                --exploit-accent: #92400e !important;
                --code-text: #065f46 !important;
                --exploit-code-text: #92400e !important;
                --domain-badge-text: #0369a1 !important;
                --indigo-badge-text: #4338ca !important;
                --link-color: #0369a1 !important;
            }
            body {
                background: #ffffff !important;
                color: #0f172a !important;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .controls-panel,
            .header-actions,
            .view-tabs,
            .copy-btn,
            .compact-toggle-btn {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .finding-expandable-body[hidden] {
                display: flex !important;
            }
            .finding-card,
            .finding-group,
            .framework-group-card,
            .framework-req-card,
            .template-section-card,
            header,
            .system-meta,
            .triage-overview {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;
                break-inside: avoid;
                content-visibility: visible !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="header-title">
                <h1>Sudoers Security Audit Report</h1>
                <p>Generated by sudo-check utility</p>
            </div>
            <div class="header-actions">
                <button class="action-btn" type="button" onclick="expandAllDisclosures(true)" title="Expand all groups and compact rows">Expand All</button>
                <button class="action-btn" type="button" onclick="expandAllDisclosures(false)" title="Collapse all groups or compact rows">Collapse All</button>
                <button class="action-btn" type="button" onclick="window.print()" title="Print or save as PDF">Print</button>
                <button class="theme-toggle-btn" id="themeToggleBtn" type="button" onclick="toggleTheme()">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m0-12.728l.707.707m11.314 11.314l.707.707M12 5a7 7 0 100 14 7 7 0 000-14z"/></svg>
                    Toggle Theme
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
        <section class="system-meta">
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Target Host:</strong> <span class="meta-pill">test-host</span></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Sudo Version:</strong> <span class="meta-pill">1.9.12</span></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Audited Sources:</strong> <span class="meta-pill" id="auditedFilesCount">3</span></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Principals:</strong> <span class="meta-pill">4</span></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Unique Rules:</strong> <span class="meta-pill">7</span></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><strong>Total Findings:</strong> <span class="meta-pill" id="totalFindingsCount">7</span></div>
        </section>
        <div class="view-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Report Views" onkeydown="handleTablistKeydown(event)">
            <button type="button" class="view-tab-btn" role="tab" id="tab-report" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-report" tabindex="0" onclick="switchViewTab('report')">
                <span>Audit Report</span>
                <span class="tab-badge">7 Findings</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="view-tab-btn" role="tab" id="tab-frameworks" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-frameworks" tabindex="-1" onclick="switchViewTab('frameworks')">
                <span>Reference Frameworks</span>
                <span class="tab-badge">17 Requirements</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="view-tab-btn" role="tab" id="tab-template" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-template" tabindex="-1" onclick="switchViewTab('template')">
                <span>Hardened Reference Template</span>
                <span class="tab-badge tab-badge-ok">Zero-Finding Baseline</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div id="panel-report" class="view-tabpanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-report">
        <section class="metrics-grid" aria-label="Severity summary">
            <button type="button" class="metric-card card-crit" id="metric-crit" aria-pressed="false" onclick="toggleSeverityCard('CRITICAL')" title="Click to filter Critical findings">
                <span class="metric-label">Critical</span>
                <span class="metric-num" id="crit-count">2</span>
                <span class="metric-hint">Click to filter</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="metric-card card-high" id="metric-high" aria-pressed="false" onclick="toggleSeverityCard('HIGH')" title="Click to filter High findings">
                <span class="metric-label">High</span>
                <span class="metric-num" id="high-count">2</span>
                <span class="metric-hint">Click to filter</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="metric-card card-med" id="metric-med" aria-pressed="false" onclick="toggleSeverityCard('MEDIUM')" title="Click to filter Medium findings">
                <span class="metric-label">Medium</span>
                <span class="metric-num" id="med-count">1</span>
                <span class="metric-hint">Click to filter</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="metric-card card-low" id="metric-low" aria-pressed="false" onclick="toggleSeverityCard('LOW')" title="Click to filter Low findings">
                <span class="metric-label">Low</span>
                <span class="metric-num" id="low-count">1</span>
                <span class="metric-hint">Click to filter</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="metric-card card-info" id="metric-info" aria-pressed="false" onclick="toggleSeverityCard('INFO')" title="Click to filter Info findings">
                <span class="metric-label">Info</span>
                <span class="metric-num" id="info-count">1</span>
                <span class="metric-hint">Click to filter</span>
            </button>
        </section>

        <div class="severity-distribution" title="Severity distribution across all findings">
            <div class="sev-seg-crit"></div>
            <div class="sev-seg-high"></div>
            <div class="sev-seg-med"></div>
            <div class="sev-seg-low"></div>
            <div class="sev-seg-info"></div>
        </div>
        <details class="triage-overview" id="triageOverview" open>
            <summary>
                <span class="triage-summary-title">
                    <span>Scope &amp; Triage Breakdown</span>
                    <span class="triage-summary-hint">Click any source file, user/group, rule, or compliance badge to filter</span>
                </span>
                <span class="triage-summary-hint">Toggle Overview</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="triage-grid">
                <div class="triage-panel">
                    <div class="triage-panel-header">
                        <span>Audited Files / Sources (3)</span>
                        <span>By Risk</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="triage-list">
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-file="/etc/sudoers" title="/etc/sudoers">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">/etc/sudoers</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-crit">1 CRIT</span><span class="mini-sev badge-high">1 HIGH</span><span class="mini-sev badge-low">1 LOW</span><span class="mini-total">(3)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-file="/etc/sudoers.d/alice" title="/etc/sudoers.d/alice">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">/etc/sudoers.d/alice</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-crit">1 CRIT</span><span class="mini-total">(1)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-file="Global Policy" title="Global Policy">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">Global Policy</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-high">1 HIGH</span><span class="mini-sev badge-med">1 MED</span><span class="mini-total">(3)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="triage-panel">
                    <div class="triage-panel-header">
                        <span>Principals / Users (4)</span>
                        <span>By Risk</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="triage-list">
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-principal="(System Host)" title="(System Host)">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">(System Host)</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-crit">1 CRIT</span><span class="mini-sev badge-high">1 HIGH</span><span class="mini-total">(2)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-principal="alice" title="alice">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">alice</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-crit">1 CRIT</span><span class="mini-total">(1)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-principal="(Global / Unscoped)" title="(Global / Unscoped)">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">(Global / Unscoped)</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-high">1 HIGH</span><span class="mini-sev badge-med">1 MED</span><span class="mini-total">(3)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-principal="bob" title="bob">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">bob</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges"><span class="mini-sev badge-low">1 LOW</span><span class="mini-total">(1)</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="triage-panel">
                    <div class="triage-panel-header">
                        <span>Triggered Rules (7)</span>
                        <span>Occurrences</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="triage-list">
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-GTFO-001" title="SUDO-GTFO-001 - Dangerous Sudo Binary allowed: find (shell)">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-GTFO-001: Dangerous Sudo Binary allowed: find (shell)</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-crit">CRITICAL</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-SYS-PERM-002" title="SUDO-SYS-PERM-002 - Sudoers Writable by Group">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-SYS-PERM-002: Sudoers Writable by Group</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-crit">CRITICAL</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-DEF-001" title="SUDO-DEF-001 - Missing or Empty secure_path">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-DEF-001: Missing or Empty secure_path</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-high">HIGH</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-SYS-PERM-004" title="SUDO-SYS-PERM-004 - Sudoers World Readable">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-SYS-PERM-004: Sudoers World Readable</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-high">HIGH</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-DEF-009" title="SUDO-DEF-009 - Missing umask Configuration">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-DEF-009: Missing umask Configuration</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-med">MEDIUM</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-GTFO-003" title="SUDO-GTFO-003 - Mitigated Dangerous Sudo Binary: vim (shell) with an extremely long finding title that exceeds one hundred and twenty millimeters in PDF header rendering width">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-GTFO-003: Mitigated Dangerous Sudo Binary: vim (shell) with an extremely long finding title that exceeds one hundred and twenty millimeters in PDF header rendering width</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-low">LOW</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="triage-row" data-facet-rule="SUDO-XSS-TEST" title="SUDO-XSS-TEST - XSS Test &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;">
                            <span class="triage-row-name">SUDO-XSS-TEST: XSS Test &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;</span>
                            <span class="triage-row-badges">
                                <span class="mini-sev badge-info">INFO</span>
                                <span class="mini-total">&times;1</span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="triage-panel-header triage-panel-header-spaced">
                        <span>Compliance Frameworks</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="compliance-tags">
                        <button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-facet-comp="CIS-5.2.3">CIS-5.2.3 (2)</button>
                        <button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-facet-comp="ANSSI-BP-028 R38">ANSSI-BP-028 R38 (1)</button>
                        <button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-facet-comp="ANSSI-BP-028 R39">ANSSI-BP-028 R39 (1)</button>
                        <button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-facet-comp="ANSSI-BP-028 R40">ANSSI-BP-028 R40 (1)</button>
                        <button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-facet-comp="CIS-5.2.4">CIS-5.2.4 (1)</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </details>
        <section class="controls-panel" aria-label="Filter and grouping controls">
            <div class="toolbar-top-row">
                <div class="search-bar">
                    <input type="text" class="search-input" id="searchInput" aria-label="Search audit findings" placeholder="Search by ID, title, command, user, host, file path, compliance..." oninput="filterFindings()">
                    <div class="search-shortcut">
                        <button type="button" class="clear-search-btn" id="clearSearchBtn" onclick="clearSearch()" title="Clear search">&times;</button>
                        <span class="kbd-hint" id="searchKbdHint">/</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="facet-selects">
                    <label class="toolbar-select-group">
                        <span>Source:</span>
                        <select class="toolbar-select" id="fileFilterSelect" onchange="setFileFilter(this.value)">
                            <option value="ALL">All Sources (3)</option>
                            <option value="/etc/sudoers">/etc/sudoers (3)</option>
                            <option value="/etc/sudoers.d/alice">/etc/sudoers.d/alice (1)</option>
                            <option value="Global Policy">Global Policy (3)</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                    <label class="toolbar-select-group">
                        <span>Principal:</span>
                        <select class="toolbar-select" id="principalFilterSelect" onchange="setPrincipalFilter(this.value)">
                            <option value="ALL">All Principals (4)</option>
                            <option value="(System Host)">(System Host) (2)</option>
                            <option value="alice">alice (1)</option>
                            <option value="(Global / Unscoped)">(Global / Unscoped) (3)</option>
                            <option value="bob">bob (1)</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                    <label class="toolbar-select-group">
                        <span>Group By:</span>
                        <select class="toolbar-select" id="groupBySelect" onchange="setGroupBy(this.value)">
                            <option value="NONE" selected>No Grouping (Severity Order)</option>
                            <option value="FILE">Source File (3)</option>
                            <option value="RULE">Rule ID / Deduplicate (7)</option>
                            <option value="USER">User / Principal (4)</option>
                            <option value="SEVERITY">Severity Level</option>
                        </select>
                    </label>
                    <div class="view-mode-group" role="group" aria-label="View density">
                        <button type="button" class="view-mode-btn active" id="btn-view-detailed" aria-pressed="true" onclick="setViewDensity('detailed')">Detailed</button>
                        <button type="button" class="view-mode-btn" id="btn-view-compact" aria-pressed="false" onclick="setViewDensity('compact')">Compact</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="toolbar-filters-row">
                <div class="filter-buttons">
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" id="btn-all" aria-pressed="true" onclick="filterSeverity('ALL')">All Severities</button>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-crit" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterSeverity('CRITICAL')">Critical (2)</button>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-high" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterSeverity('HIGH')">High (2)</button>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-med" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterSeverity('MEDIUM')">Medium (1)</button>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-low" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterSeverity('LOW')">Low (1)</button>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-info" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterSeverity('INFO')">Info (1)</button>
                </div>
                <div class="filter-buttons">
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" id="btn-cat-all" aria-pressed="true" onclick="filterCategory('ALL')">All Domains</button>
                    <div class="policy-filter-group" id="policyFilterGroup" role="group" aria-label="Policy domain filters">
                        <button type="button" class="filter-btn filter-btn-parent" id="btn-cat-policy" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterCategory('POLICY')" title="All sudoers policy findings (GTFObins + Commands + Defaults)">Policy (5)</button>
                        <div class="policy-subfilters">
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn filter-btn-sub" id="btn-dom-gtfo" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterCategory('GTFOBINS')">GTFObins (2)</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn filter-btn-sub" id="btn-dom-cmd" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterCategory('COMMANDS')">Commands (0)</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn filter-btn-sub" id="btn-dom-def" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterCategory('DEFAULTS')">Defaults (2)</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" id="btn-cat-system" aria-pressed="false" onclick="filterCategory('SYSTEM')">System (2)</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="toolbar-status-row">
                <div role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
                    Showing <strong id="visibleFindingsCount">7</strong> of <strong id="totalFindingsInline">7</strong> findings
                </div>
                <div class="active-filters-list" id="activeFiltersList"></div>
                <button type="button" class="reset-filters-btn" id="resetFiltersBtn" onclick="resetAllFilters()">Reset All Filters</button>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="findings-list" id="findingsContainer">
            <article class="finding-card" id="finding-1" data-order="1" data-id="SUDO-SYS-PERM-002" data-severity="CRITICAL" data-category="SYSTEM" data-domain="SYSTEM" data-file="/etc/sudoers" data-principal="(System Host)" data-compliance="CIS-5.2.3">
                <div class="finding-header">
                    <div class="finding-title-sec">
                        <div class="finding-meta-top">
                            <span class="finding-id">SUDO-SYS-PERM-002</span>
                            <span class="domain-badge">System Host</span><button type="button" class="location-pill" data-action="filter-file" title="Filter by source file">/etc/sudoers:1</button>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="finding-title">Sudoers Writable by Group</h2>
                        <div class="compact-summary-pills">
                            <span class="compact-pill">/etc/sudoers:1</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-header-right">
                        <span class="sev-badge badge-crit">CRITICAL</span>
                        <button type="button" class="compact-toggle-btn" aria-expanded="true" data-action="toggle-compact">Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="finding-expandable-body">
                    <div class="finding-details-grid">
                        <div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Source:</strong> System Health Check</div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Target Path:</strong> <button type="button" class="clickable-meta" data-action="filter-file">/etc/sudoers:1</button></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="compliance-tags"><button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-comp="CIS-5.2.3">CIS-5.2.3</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="finding-desc">The sudoers file &#39;/etc/sudoers&#39; has group write permissions: -rw-rw-r--.</p>
                    <div class="finding-remediation">
                        <div class="remediation-title">Remediation</div>
                        <div class="remediation-content"><p>Run &#39;chmod 0440 /etc/sudoers&#39; to restrict write access.</p>
                            <div class="remediation-code-block">
                                <div class="remediation-code-header">
                                    <span class="remediation-code-label">Remediation Command</span>
                                    <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-action="copy-code">Copy</button>
                                </div>
                                <pre tabindex="0"><code>chmod 0440 /etc/sudoers</code></pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-exploit">
                        <div class="exploit-header">
                            <span class="exploit-title">Exploit / Verification Reference</span>
                            <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-action="copy-code">Copy</button>
                        </div>
                        <pre tabindex="0"><code>echo &#39;ALL ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL&#39; &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="finding-card" id="finding-2" data-order="2" data-id="SUDO-SYS-PERM-004" data-severity="HIGH" data-category="SYSTEM" data-domain="SYSTEM" data-file="/etc/sudoers" data-principal="(System Host)" data-compliance="CIS-5.2.3,ANSSI-BP-028-R39">
                <div class="finding-header">
                    <div class="finding-title-sec">
                        <div class="finding-meta-top">
                            <span class="finding-id">SUDO-SYS-PERM-004</span>
                            <span class="domain-badge">System Host</span><button type="button" class="location-pill" data-action="filter-file" title="Filter by source file">/etc/sudoers</button>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="finding-title">Sudoers World Readable</h2>
                        <div class="compact-summary-pills">
                            <span class="compact-pill">/etc/sudoers</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-header-right">
                        <span class="sev-badge badge-high">HIGH</span>
                        <button type="button" class="compact-toggle-btn" aria-expanded="true" data-action="toggle-compact">Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="finding-expandable-body">
                    <div class="finding-details-grid">
                        <div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Source:</strong> System Health Check</div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Target Path:</strong> <button type="button" class="clickable-meta" data-action="filter-file">/etc/sudoers</button></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="compliance-tags"><button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-comp="CIS-5.2.3">CIS-5.2.3</button><button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-comp="ANSSI-BP-028-R39">ANSSI-BP-028-R39</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="finding-desc">The sudoers file &#39;/etc/sudoers&#39; is world-readable.</p>
                    <div class="finding-remediation">
                        <div class="remediation-title">Remediation</div>
                        <div class="remediation-content"><p>Upgrade permissions on /etc/sudoers.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="finding-card" id="finding-3" data-order="3" data-id="SUDO-GTFO-001" data-severity="CRITICAL" data-category="POLICY" data-domain="GTFOBINS" data-file="/etc/sudoers.d/alice" data-principal="alice" data-compliance="ANSSI-BP-028-R40">
                <div class="finding-header">
                    <div class="finding-title-sec">
                        <div class="finding-meta-top">
                            <span class="finding-id">SUDO-GTFO-001</span>
                            <span class="domain-badge">GTFObins</span><button type="button" class="location-pill" data-action="filter-file" title="Filter by source file">/etc/sudoers.d/alice:42</button>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="finding-title">Dangerous Sudo Binary allowed: find (shell)</h2>
                        <div class="compact-summary-pills"><span class="compact-pill" title="User/Group">alice</span><span class="compact-pill" title="Command">/usr/bin/find</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-header-right">
                        <span class="sev-badge badge-crit">CRITICAL</span>
                        <button type="button" class="compact-toggle-btn" aria-expanded="true" data-action="toggle-compact">Details</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="finding-expandable-body">
                    <div class="rule-preview-bar">
                        <code class="rule-preview-code">alice prod-db = (root:root) /usr/bin/find</code>
                        <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-action="copy-sibling">Copy Rule</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-details-grid">
                        <div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Source:</strong> Sudoers Policy</div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>User/Group:</strong> <button type="button" class="clickable-meta" data-action="filter-principal">alice</button></div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Host:</strong> prod-db</div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>RunAs:</strong> root:root</div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Command:</strong> <code>/usr/bin/find</code></div><div class="finding-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <button type="button" class="clickable-meta" data-action="filter-file">/etc/sudoers.d/alice:42</button></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="compliance-tags"><button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-comp="ANSSI-BP-028-R40">ANSSI-BP-028-R40</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="finding-desc">The command &#39;find&#39; is allowed — and can be used → to bypass sudo restrictions.</p>
                    <div class="finding-remediation">
                        <div class="remediation-title">Remediation</div>
                        <div class="remediation-content"><p>Review if &#39;find&#39; requires elevated privileges.</p>
                            <div class="remediation-code-block">
                                <div class="remediation-code-header">
                                    <span class="remediation-code-label">Example Sudoers Configuration (visudo)</span>
                                    <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-action="copy-code">Copy</button>
                                </div>
                                <pre tabindex="0"><code># Apply NOEXEC tag in /etc/sudoers.d/alice:
alice prod-db = (root:root) NOEXEC: /usr/bin/find /var/log -maxdepth 1</code></pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="finding-exploit">
                        <div class="exploit-header">
                            <span class="exploit-title">Exploit / Verification Reference</span>
                            <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-action="copy-code">Copy</button>
                        </div>
                        <pre tabindex="0"><code>sudo find . -exec /bin/sh \; -quit</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="finding-card" id="finding-4" data-order="4" data-id="SUDO-DEF-001" data-severity="HIGH" data-category="POLICY" data-domain="DEFAULTS" data-file="Global Policy" data-principal="(Global / Unscoped)" data-compliance="CIS-5.2.4">
                <div class="finding-header">
