                    <div class="compliance-tags"><button type="button" class="compliance-badge" data-comp="CIS-5.2.4">CIS-5.2.4</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="finding-desc">The sudoers policy does not define a &#39;secure_path&#39;.</p>
                    <div class="finding-remediation">
                        <div class="remediation-title">Remediation</div>
                        <div class="remediation-content"><p>Add Defaults secure_path=&#34;/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin&#34; to sudoers.</p>
